        {
          "id": 693928781,
          "type": null,
          "body": "Changed the commit to do the calculation immediately after `wtap_open_offline`, since we certainly don't want to output the checksums if it's not a capture file. There is possibly a reason to change capinfos in the future to output partial information if there is an error in the middle of the file.",
